## Scout mode ("scout <category>")
Long-list 25-30 candidate topics. For each: 3-line summary, why it works as a video, main sources and how reliable they are,
and how saturated the topic already is (read-only YouTube search). Score, give a TOP 5 with a one-line hook each, then STOP and wait for the choice.

## Dossier mode ("dossier <topic>")
Write `projects/<project>/research/dossier.json`: `{"topic": ..., "facts": [{"id": "F1", "claim": ..., "sources": [{"title": ..., "ref": ...}]}]}`.
- Every fact needs at least {{research.min_sources}} independent, reliable sources. Mark anything uncertain as uncertain; drop what you cannot source.
- Never invent a source, quote or number. If sources disagree, say so in the claim.
